  "name": "Drug Named Entity Recognition",
  "alternateName": [
    "drug-named-entity-recognition"
  ],
  "description": "Lightweight Python library for identifying drug and medication names in free text, with fuzzy matching for misspellings and integration with OMOP (Observational Medical Outcomes Partnership) concept IDs and SMILES molecular notation. Works with spaCy and NLTK tokenizers. Available as a pip package and includes a Google Sheets plugin for non-programmer users.",
